  "limitations": "Exit codes report the server-provided classification; receipt correctness, session existence, approval validity and durable recovery stay EventLog/ControlPlane-owned. Pagination is a bounded page split of one TTY body, not a pager: no process, no terminal control, no read-back of the user's answer. The frozen kiana-entrypoints/src/cli.rs is not migrated to this presenter; no local compilation or test run happened for this slice, so byte-level pipe/PTY evidence and Web parity beyond the shared response classification remain open."
